# Verify Summary
Launch/doctor: `node --version`; no long-lived process is needed.
Drive: `node cli.mjs rows.json` from the project root.
Evidence: capture the command and returned JSON in an owned evidence directory.
Cleanup: remove temporary inputs only; keep evidence.
Read [the feature map](features/README.md).
